    <node id="&quot;BELORUSSKAYA (KOLTSEVAYA LINE)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Belorusskaya (Koltsevaya line) is a station on the Moscow Metro's Koltsevaya line, named after the nearby Belorussky Rail Terminal, and opened in 1952."</data>
